う、プログラミング言語が自然言語に近づけば近づくほど、訳がわからなくなる現象があると思います\n個人的な偏見かもしれないですがw","ts":"1619105280.349600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bxp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43601851-689a-4e0a-916b-db01d9d42281","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"FORTHというより日本語化したPostScriptとでも言った方がいいのか","ts":"1619104838.347300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U01J3CK2SQH"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B49"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68325d99-8c40-47ed-83b6-e5f46e662ad0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"FORTHという言語を見た時に覚えた感情に似ている","ts":"1619104759.346200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H+xo2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5B6BEE16-E37C-4BD0-9B25-9189FC9220BF","type":"message","user":"U01J3CK2SQH","text":"\u003chttps://dolittle.eplang.jp/_media/dolittlekurebayashi.pdf|https://dolittle.eplang.jp/_media/dolittlekurebayashi.pdf\u003e","ts":"1619104557.345700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YSx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"666E7E68-18E1-4DD2-B65E-0775DCA6D946","type":"message","user":"U01J3CK2SQH","text":"大学でドリトルという意味不明な日本語プログラミング言語使ってました\nロゴの日本語版みたいなやつです\n\nかめた＝タートル！作る。\n 三角形＝「かめた！100　歩く　120　左回り」!3　繰り返す（赤）図形を作る。\n 三角形2＝三角形！作る。\n 三角形2！150　0　移動する。\n\n↑ こんな感じ\n\nプログラミング経験者としてはシンタックスめっちゃくちゃ辛かった\n「」って何？ブロック？びっくりマークはメソッド？？パラメータは一体どうなってんの","ts":"1619104508.345500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EQnHJ"}]}]
